detail.abstract:
This talk is devoted to the role of pi in mathematics, probability and stochastic processes, as the title says. After short introduction about the role pi in mathematics, I will move&nbsp;to some results in probability associated with pi. Then I will be discussing several results in stochastic processes that related to pi, and their applications in finance and insurance. 
<br>
 Some recent results in those areas will be discussed as well.&nbsp;
